41,2025-04-29,松葉屋茶寮 / OKASHIYA 羽田空港期間限定ショップがオープン,0,,1,<p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Times; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0); color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0);"><span class="s1" style="font-kerning: none;">5月1日（木）より、羽田空港にて</span></p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Times; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0); color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0);"><span class="s1" style="font-kerning: none;">「松葉屋茶寮 / OKASHIYA」の期間限定ショップをオープンいたします。</span></p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Times; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0); color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0);"><span class="s1" style="font-kerning: none;">出店場所は、羽田空港第2ターミナル2階、ANA FESTA 61番ゲートショップ内。</span></p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Times; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0); color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0);"><span class="s1" style="font-kerning: none;">国内線ご搭乗のお客様専用エリアにて、OKASHIYA特製クッキーを取り揃えております。</span></p><p class="p2" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Times; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0); min-height: 14px; color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0);"><span class="s1" style="font-kerning: none;"></span><br></p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Times; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0); color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0);"><span class="s1" style="font-kerning: none;">旅立ちのひとときに、また大切な方へのお手土産に。</span></p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Times; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0); color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0);"><span class="s1" style="font-kerning: none;">東京発、季節を映す味わいを、この機会にぜひお手に取ってご覧ください。</span></p><p class="p2" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Times; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0); min-height: 14px; color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0);"><span class="s1" style="font-kerning: none;"></span><br></p><p class="p2" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Times; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0); min-height: 14px; color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0);"><br></p><p class="p2" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Times; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0); min-height: 14px; color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0);"><br></p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Times; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0); color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0);"><span class="s1" style="font-kerning: none;">店舗情報</span></p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Times; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0); color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0);"><span class="s1" style="font-kerning: none;">出店期間：2025年5月1日（木）〜</span></p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Times; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0); color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0);"><span class="s1" style="font-kerning: none;">営業時間：6:15〜20:00</span></p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Times; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0); color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0);"><span class="s1" style="font-kerning: none;">場所：羽田空港第2ターミナル2F 出発ゲートラウンジ内 ANA FESTA 61番ゲートショップ</span></p><p class="p2" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Times; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0); min-height: 14px; color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0);"><span class="s1" style="font-kerning: none;"></span><br></p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Times; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0); color: rgb(0__kanma__ 0__kanma__ 0);"><span class="s1" style="font-kerning: none;">※店舗は保安検査場を通過後のエリアにございます。飛行機にご搭乗のお客様のみご利用いただけます。</span></p>,1,
40,2025-04-17,音に耳を澄ませ、自分に向き合うひととき 「YAKUZEN茶音(やくぜんさおん)」,2,,1,<p class="p1" helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"="" style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; margin: 0px;"><font color="#222222"><span style="font-size: 13px;">忙しい毎日に、静かに心を澄ませる時間を。</span></font></p><p class="p1" helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"="" style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; margin: 0px;"><font color="#222222"><span style="font-size: 13px;"><br></span></font></p><p class="p1" helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"="" style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; margin: 0px;"><font color="#222222"><span style="font-size: 13px;">「YAKUZEN茶音 - やくぜんさおん - 」を4/20(日)より開催いたします。</span></font></p>	<p class="p1" helvetica="" neue";="" margin:="" 0px;="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"="" style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;"><font color="#222222"><span style="font-size: 13px;">音に耳を澄まし、自分自身と静かに向き合うひととき。</span></font></p><p class="p1" helvetica="" neue";="" margin:="" 0px;="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"="" style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;"><font color="#222222"><span style="font-size: 13px;">自らお茶を点てることで、自分自身の「音」と「感覚」に触れていく。</span></font></p><p class="p1" helvetica="" neue";="" margin:="" 0px;="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"="" style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;"><font color="#222222"><span style="font-size: 13px;">また、脳神経外科医監修のサウンドトリートメントと和蝋燭のゆらぎの中で脳をリラックスさせ、</span></font></p><p class="p1" helvetica="" neue";="" margin:="" 0px;="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"="" style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;"><font color="#222222"><span style="font-size: 13px;">茶人が点てたお茶の音に心を委ねる。</span></font></p><p class="p1" helvetica="" neue";="" margin:="" 0px;="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"="" style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;"><font color="#222222"><span style="font-size: 13px;"><br></span></font></p><p class="p3" hiragino="" sans";="" margin:="" 0px;="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"="" style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal;">五感を研ぎ澄まし、心と体を内側から整える新しい体験です。</p>	ご予約について<div><font color="#ffffff"><br></font></div><div><font color="#ffffff">開催日（すべて13:30〜）：</font></div><div><font color="#ffffff">4/20(日)、4/25(金)、4/28(月)、4/30(水)</font></div><div><font color="#ffffff">※完全予約制・少人数限定</font></div><div><font color="#ffffff"><br></font></div><div><font color="#ffffff">ご予約方法：</font></div><div><font color="#ffffff">松葉屋茶寮の［<a href="https://www.tablecheck.com/ja/matsubayasaryo-hakobunegallery/reserve/message" style="color: rgb(255__kanma__ 255__kanma__ 255);">TableCheck</a>］より日時を指定のうえ、ご予約ください。</font></div><div><br style="color: rgb(255__kanma__ 255__kanma__ 255); font-size: medium;"></div>,1,
39,2025-04-10,桜茶会,2,,1,<p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="white-space-collapse: preserve;">松葉屋茶寮にて、春の季節を室内で味わう特別な茶会「桜茶会」を開催いたしました。</span></p><p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="white-space-collapse: preserve;"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="white-space-collapse: preserve;">会場の茶席には、この茶会のために特別に用意した桜の盆栽をしつらえ、</span></p><p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="white-space-collapse: preserve;">外の景色とはまた異なる、静かで奥行きのある春の情景を演出いたしました。</span></p>	<p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="white-space-collapse: preserve;">桜前線が南から北へと移ろうように、四種のお茶と四種のお菓子で構成し、</span></p><p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="white-space-collapse: preserve;">南から桜がほころび始め、やがて北上しながら蕾がふくらみ、</span></p><p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="white-space-collapse: preserve;">ついに私たちの元で桜が咲き誇る</span><span style="white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 10pt;">――</span></p><p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 10pt;">そんな春の物語を、味わいや香りはもちろん、</span></p><p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 10pt;">茶葉やお菓子に込められた土地の風土ごとお楽しみいただけるようお届けいたしました。</span></p><div><span style="white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 10pt;"><br></span></div>	<p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="white-space-collapse: preserve;">ご参加くださった皆様には花を愛でる心とともに、</span></p><p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;">時の移ろいに静かに身をゆだねるひとときをお楽しみいただけたようです。</span></p>	<p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="white-space-collapse: preserve;">ご来場いただいた皆様、誠にありがとうございました。</span></p><p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="white-space-collapse: preserve;">今後も、季節の移ろいを五感で味わう茶会を企画してまいります。</span></p><p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="white-space-collapse: preserve;">ぜひ、またの機会にお目にかかれますように。</span></p>,1,
38,2025-04-01,2025年4月1日（火）松屋銀座にて「松葉屋茶寮 / OKASHIYA」の曜日限定特設店舗をオープン,0,,1,<div>「松葉屋茶寮 / OKASHIYA」は、日本の伝統菓子に現代の感性を織り交ぜ、</div><div><span style="font-size: 10pt;">四季折々の素材を贅沢に使った特別なスイーツ作りにこだわっています。</span></div><div><font color="#ffffff"><br></font></div><div><font color="#ffffff">ザクッとほどけて、ホロッと溶ける素材を極めたクッキーや、</font>旬の恵みが優しく広がり、口の中でふんわりほどけ、<span style="font-size: 10pt;">奥ゆかしい余韻を残すスイーツをご用意いたしました。 </span></div><div><font color="#f"><br>fffff</font></div><div><font color="#ffffff">週に4日だけ訪れる特別な甘味のひととき。</font></div><div><font color="#ffffff">シンプルでありながら奥深い味わいを、ぜひご賞味ください。</font></div><div><font color="#ffffff"><br></font></div><div><br></div><div><font color="#ffffff">▪︎営業期間：2025年4月1日（火）～ ※期間限定</font></div><div><font color="#ffffff">▪︎営業日：毎週 日・月・火・水曜日（週4日間）</font></div><div><font color="#ffffff">▪︎営業時間：11:00～20:00</font></div><div><font color="#ffffff">▪︎場所：松屋銀座 地下1階</font></div>,1,
37,2025-02-08,ボッテガ・ヴェネタイベント,2,,1,2月8日(土)から2月9日(日)まで、<div>ボッテガ・ヴェネタ銀座フラッグシップにてイベントを開催しました。</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>	<p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: " helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"=""><br></p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: " helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"=""><br></p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: " helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"=""><br></p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: " helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"="">松葉屋茶寮は、青い香りを残した青ほうじ茶をシャンパンのように仕立て、</p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: " helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"="">桜の葉のパウダーをふりかけることで、桜そのものの自然な風合いをウェルカムドリンクで表現。</p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: " helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"=""><br></p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: " helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(255__kanma__="" 255__kanma__="" 255);"="">フードには、桜の香りを閉じ込めた桜バターサンドを添え、</p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: " helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(255__kanma__="" 255__kanma__="" 255);"="">季節の移ろいを感じていただきました。</p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: " helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(255__kanma__="" 255__kanma__="" 255);"=""><br></p><p class="p1" style="margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: " helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(255__kanma__="" 255__kanma__="" 255);"=""><br></p><p class="p1" helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"="" style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px;">また、キュレーターとしてTRADMANSの盆栽ワークショップを実施。</p><p class="p1" helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"="" style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px;"><br></p><p class="p1" helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"="" style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px;">盆栽を通じて、日本の古典美と職人技の奥深さに触れながら、</p><p class="p1" helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"="" style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px;">自然が生み出す美と人の手がつくる美の関係を探求しました。</p><p class="p1" helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"="" style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px;"><br></p><p class="p1" helvetica="" neue";="" color:="" rgb(0__kanma__="" 0__kanma__="" 0);"="" style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px;"><br></p><p class="p1" helvetica="" neue";="" co